Package: personenzaehler
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: PersonenZähler Project <noreply@example.invalid>
Depends: adduser, desktop-file-utils, shared-mime-info, python3 (>= 3.11), python3-numpy, python3-opencv, python3-psutil, python3-yaml, python3-cryptography, python3-pyside6.qtcore, python3-pyside6.qtgui, python3-pyside6.qtwidgets, pkexec, polkitd
Recommends: v4l-utils, avahi-daemon
Suggests: hailort, hailo-all
Description: Native Hailo-accelerated dual-camera people counter
 PersonenZähler is a privacy-oriented native Linux desktop suite for a
 Raspberry Pi 5 with Hailo-10H, YOLO26m and two local or network cameras.
 It includes a first-run wizard, service management, diagnostics, a local API,
 signed license verification and privacy-preserving aggregate statistics.
